        "> **oneDNN must be disabled on this build.** With the default (oneDNN",
        "    enabled) both tiers **loaded",
        "> successfully and then failed at predict**:",
        ">",
        "> ```",
        "> NotImplementedError: (Unimplemented)",
        "    ConvertPirAttribute2RuntimeAttribute not support",
        "> [pir::ArrayAttribute<pir::DoubleAttribute>]  (onednn_instruction.cc:118)",
        "> ```",
        ">",
        "> This is a oneDNN/PIR kernel incompatibility in `paddlepaddle 3.3.1`,",
        "    **not a bad model or a failed",
        "> download** — the same files succeed unchanged once oneDNN is off. Two",
        "    equivalent remedies were",
        "> measured to work: `enable_mkldnn=False` on the `PaddleOCR` constructor,",
        "    or the environment variable",
        "> `FLAGS_use_mkldnn=0`. Setting only `FLAGS_enable_pir_api=0` does **not**",
        "    fix it."
      ],
